Package: localmind
Version: 1.0.0
Section: audio
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.22), libglib2.0-0 (>= 2.50), libc6 (>= 2.17)
Recommends: libcudart11.0, libnvidia-ml1
Suggests: nvidia-cuda-toolkit
Installed-Size: 500000
Maintainer: Kaivalya Anand Pandey <kaivalyaanandpandey666@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/KaivalyaDeepTeam/LocalMind
Description: Free, open-source AI for audio transcription and quality auditing
 LocalMind is a desktop application that provides:
 .
  - Local audio transcription using Whisper models
  - Quality auditing with customizable scoring parameters
  - Support for multiple LLM backends (local, OpenAI, Anthropic)
  - Professional PDF report generation
  - 100% offline operation after model download
 .
 Perfect for call centers, quality assurance teams, and anyone needing
 to transcribe and analyze audio conversations.
